# Mob commands from the stage manager (30005) in the fixture area tools/fixtures/files/mobcmds.are, with only
# area_update running, in the temple (3001). Decimus (10) gives each cue; the understudy (30006) and Smokegod
# (60, who sees the gecho as an immortal) are there too, and Heroic (51) is in the temple square (3005), to hear
# the asound.
# - echoes: echo, echoat, echoaround, asound, zecho and gecho, the ones with nothing to say, and a mob command
#   that isn't one
# - loads: mload and oload (to inventory, the room and worn; at too high a level, with bad words); junk by name,
#   worn, all.bottle and all; purge a mob, an object, a player (refused) and everything
# - the mob command typed by Decimus (his trust is too low: nothing) and by Smokegod (60, it runs); mpstat and
#   mpdump
# - deep: a program that calls itself six times is stopped at MAX_CALL_LEVEL, which then refuses every program
#   (#87): echoes does nothing
@place mobcmds.are mobcmds.are
@place area-mobcmds.lst area.lst
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
holylight
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
@mob 30006 3001
@mob 30005 3001
@as dec
say echoes
say loads
look
say junk
look
@mob 3062 3001
say purge
look
mob echo Decimus tries it.
@as god
mob echo Smokegod tries it.
mpstat manager
mpstat decimus
mpstat nobody
mpstat
mpstat understudy
mpdump 30044
mpdump 1
@as dec
say deep
say echoes
@state
